  "limits": [
    "Scores are nominal simulator metres from idealized state estimates, not Hill Climb Racing performance.",
    "Validation seeds were used for exploratory model/runtime selection; final test seeds remain untouched.",
    "Episode bootstrap intervals condition on one trained policy; they do not measure training-seed uncertainty.",
    "Only three training replicates compare PPO CPU256 and CEM; CPU64/CUDA256 screening each has one seed.",
    "Runtime screens were sequential in a fixed order on a shared workstation; background load and thermal drift are uncontrolled.",
    "Training clocks include env/model/optimizer initialization, collection, updates and callbacks; module import/provenance and offline evaluation are separately outside this clock.",
